---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — WasPetInsuranceWorthIt.com"
  description="Privacy policy for WasPetInsuranceWorthIt.com. Calculator inputs stay in your browser, never transmitted or stored. Cookies and AdSense explained."
>
  <article class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: September 21, 2026</p>

    <h2>What the Calculator Does With Your Inputs</h2>
    <p>
      Every calculation on WasPetInsuranceWorthIt.com runs in your browser. When you enter your
      pet's species, breed, age, spending range, incident history, and insurance status, those
      values stay on your device and the math is performed there. Your inputs and your result are
      not transmitted to us, not stored by us, and not logged by us. Pressing "Calculate" makes no
      request to our server, there is no optional upload or contribution step, and there is no
      database behind the calculator. Nothing is saved between visits
      — closing or refreshing the page clears everything you entered.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not ask for and do not receive your name, email address, postal address, phone number,
      IP address, or your pet's name in connection with the calculator. Because nothing is sent,
      there is nothing for us to connect back to you.
    </p>

    <h2>Server Logs</h2>
    <p>
      Like any website, this site is served by a hosting provider (Cloudflare). When your browser
      requests a page, the hosting provider's infrastructure may record standard request
      information such as the page requested, the time of the request, your IP address, and your
      browser's user-agent string. This is ordinary web-server logging, it is handled by the
      hosting provider under its own privacy policy, and it does not include anything you type
      into the calculator. We do not use these logs to identify or profile individual visitors.
    </p>

    <h2>No Accounts, No Mailing Lists</h2>
    <p>
      There are no user accounts on this site. There is no sign-up, no login, no newsletter, and
      no marketing list. We have no visitor data to sell, rent, or share with insurance companies,
      brokers, lead generators, or any other third party, and we do not do so.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies Set By This Site</h2>
    <p>
      This site sets no first-party cookies of its own. It does not use Google Analytics, and it
      does not use localStorage or similar browser storage to remember you between visits.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      Page views are counted with Cloudflare Web Analytics, which Cloudflare runs as part of
      hosting this site.{' '}
      <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Cloudflare states
      </a>{' '}
      that it "does not use any client-side state, such as cookies or localStorage, to collect
      usage metrics" and does not "fingerprint" individuals by IP address or User Agent string. It
      gives this site page-view totals, not information about you.
    </p>

    <h2>Google AdSense</h2>
    <p>
      This site uses Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google is a third party and may set
      its own cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this site or other websites — this
      is separate from the statement above, which covers only cookies set by us. You can opt out of
      personalized advertising by visiting{' '}
      <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Google Ads Settings
      </a>. Google's use of advertising cookies is governed by its{' '}
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Privacy Policy
      </a>. We do not receive the data Google collects through those cookies, and because your
      calculator inputs never leave your browser, they cannot be shared with Google or any
      advertiser.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      If the site's behaviour changes — for example, if we add a feature that collects something
      not listed above — this page will be updated to describe it before that feature ships, and
      the "last updated" date at the top will change.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this privacy policy:
      <!--email_off-->vetorainfo@gmail.com<!--/email_off-->. See the{' '}
      <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> for more.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
